<p>Concentrate on the corruption you bring, enhancing each of your melee strikes with <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">23, 31, 37, 42, 46</acronym> blight damage (which also heals you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">9.07, 12, 15, 17, 19</acronym> each hit).</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>